WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.125
CHRIS HADFIELD:
Suddenly, I realize

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:06.375
we are leaking liquid ammonia.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:11.500
And that's where you start
thinking, am I ready for it.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.958
CONDOLEEZZA RICE: September 11.

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:16.666
I said, Mr. President, it was
reaching a point of no return.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:19.791
So we show up at a Chase
Manhattan Bank with hostages.

00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:21.958
And whether those three
people lived or died--

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:22.458
[GUNFIRE]

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:24.583
 --Was on me.

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:26.416
CHRIS HADFIELD: As a
spaceship commander,

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:33.250
the real question always is,
what are you going to do next?

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:38.291
We see somebody come to the
door and he can't get out.

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:41.166
CHRIS HADFIELD: We have to
do a Hail Mary spacewalk.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.583
It's just the ultimate test.

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:45.000
CONDOLEEZZA RICE:
You really don't

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.250
know at that point
what to believe,

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.375
and you still have
to make decisions.

